          Contact_Facsimile_Telephone: (970) 224-3001
          Contact_Electronic_Mail_Address: meishag@tgstech.com
          Hours_of_Service: Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m., Mountain Standard Time
       Process_Step_Citation:  Users interested in the methods used during the georeferencing process can 
           refer to the training manual developed by the NOAA Coastal Services Center.  This manual is 
           available on their shoreline data web site for free download and is saved in Adobe .pdf format.  
           http://www.csc.noaa.gov/products/shorelines
